 Running total 5\,900\nof 96\,744. The batch-119 fetch then hit a 429 user-
 rate\nlimit on its first call (retry-after 22:54:59 EDT) and\nthe run 
 stopped entirely per the standing rule\, with no\nrecords lost. New 
 attention items include the\nautomation-failure cluster opening Jul 20\, a
  fifth named\nemployer interested in his profile\, and a 
 legal/financial\nfollow-up awaiting his income information. 
 Checkpoint\npaused for resume from batch 119 after the retry-after.
DTSTAMP:20261022T215308Z
END:VEVENT
