 batch fetched and the following one partial.\nSeveral later runs exited 
 quietly under the concurrency\nguard. The checkpoint was verified stale\, 
 reset to paused\,\nand the midday recovery run classified the fetched 
 batch\,\nre-fetched the partial batch in full\, and continued\; 
 the\nrecovery is recorded in that run's own calendar entry.
