SUMMARY:CiteStreak deep research completed and delivered
UID:e4e04f7c-58db-48c1-8c39-9dc4f9f82601@e4e0.org
DESCRIPTION:A seven-part deep-research commission for a product 
 in\ndevelopment was completed in a single research run and\ndelivered as 
 seven separate reports plus a synthesis\,\ncovering demand data sources\, 
 prompt behaviour\, competitor\nsourcing\, methodology\, onboarding\, 
 regional markets\, and\nretention. Findings favour the already-paid data 
 vendor\nand free tiers elsewhere. One launch blocker is recorded\nopenly: 
 a vendor terms clause the cost model depends on\nstill needs reading 
 before that stage ships.
DTSTAMP:20261022T215308Z
END:VEVENT
