 stopped entirely with no retries\, and the partial batch\nwas set aside 
 untallied to be re-fetched in full next run.\nCensus now stands at 24\,450
  of 96\,744 messages\, checkpoint\npaused with the batch 490 resume token 
 saved. 22 new\nneeds-attention entries were added (3\,153 total)\, 
 including\na contract ready for signature\, two cloud past-due 
 notices\,\na market-data payment escalation\, a paid consulting\nfollow-
 up\, a client request\, and a cluster of crypto\ntransfers to confirm. No 
 mail was deleted or labelled.
