SUMMARY:Sunshade indexing diagnosis: encoding is the cause\; owner kept 
 list as-is
UID:c3e7e40d-1a6d-4f4f-a640-c5d80eab0a74@c3e7.org
DESCRIPTION:A diagnostic run established why one paper page had\nfailed 
 live tests repeatedly since early October: the\nraw unencoded URL breaks 
 the search console live-test\nbackend\, while the percent-encoded form 
 passes and can\nbe indexed\; the page itself is fine. Later the same 
 day\nthe owner decided to leave the daily indexing list\nexactly as-is\, 
 keeping the raw form and not extending\nan existing exclusion\; both 
 decisions are settled.
DTSTAMP:20261022T215308Z
END:VEVENT
