BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART;TZID=/ics.py/2020.1/America/Toronto:20261019T123300
DURATION:PT20M
SUMMARY:Study: how older Paper vs Explainer ad groups work
UID:2afd8f27-1815-4401-a9c1-f685b2becc31@2afd.org
DESCRIPTION:Read-only study of the paired Paper/Explainer ad groups in\nthe
  rotation campaign (four topics in depth\, six metrics-only).\nFinding: 
 both labels land on the identical paper page\; the\nsplit is keyword and 
 copy angle - Paper runs few scholarly\nphrase keywords with source-
 document copy\, Explainer runs\nlarger plain-language sets with guide-
 voice copy that bridges\nto the paper. Which side performs is topic-
 dependent.
DTSTAMP:20261022T215308Z
END:VEVENT
