DESCRIPTION:A Google Trends scraper was built in Python at the 
 user's\nrequest: country and city geo targeting\, keyword search\nand 
 batching\, related queries\, trending feed\, caching\,\nrate limiting and 
 proxy support. Live verification passed\nall ten checks. One limit found: 
 related-topics data is\nquota-gated from datacenter IPs\, and the client 
 raises an\nexplicit error instead of returning fake-empty data\; 
 the\nproduction path is a residential proxy. Published to\nGitHub with a 
 Drive mirror.
DTSTAMP:20261022T215308Z
END:VEVENT
